---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jason: a master's student in data science and engineering, exploring Engineer, AI, Lifestyle, and Health." lang="en">
  <section class="about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <header class="about-intro">
      <img class="about-avatar" src="/images/avatar.jpg" alt="Jason's avatar" />
      <h1 id="about-title">About Jason's Notes</h1>
      <p>Some things I'm researching and exploring: Engineer · AI · Lifestyle · Health · ……</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-story">
      <h2>Who I am</h2>
      <p>Hi, I'm Jason, a master's student in the School of Data Science and Engineering at East China Normal University. This is my notebook — where I keep the code I write, the books I read, what I learn from training, and everything that makes me want to keep exploring.</p>
      <h2>What I'm exploring</h2>
      <p>Writing code is my main thing, and I stay curious about AI and new tools. The directions I want to spend time on lately are <strong>Engineer · AI · Lifestyle · Health · ……</strong></p>
      <h2>How to reach me</h2>
      <p>You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/zhguichen">GitHub</a>, or <a href="/rss.xml">subscribe to the RSS feed</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
